# Burritos

Based on [https://www.spoonfulofflavor.com/sweet-potato-black-bean-quinoa-bowls/…](https://www.spoonfulofflavor.com/sweet-potato-black-bean-quinoa-bowls/) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251125114813/https://www.spoonfulofflavor.com/sweet-potato-black-bean-quinoa-bowls/))

{ rating="5" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] (10-inch) [burrito sized tortillas]{ ing="burrito-sized-tortillas" }
- [ ] [Brown rice]{ ing="brown-rice" }, cooked

      - [ ] Add lime Add [lime zest and juice]{ ing="lime-zest-and-juice" }
      - [ ] [Add cilantro]{ ing="add-cilantro" }
- [ ] [Taco Seasoning]{ ing="taco-seasoning" } (add to either peppers or meat)

      - [ ] (Optional) 1 lb ground meat and tsp of [salt]{ ing="salt" }
      - [ ] (Optional) Sauteed peppers [and red onion]{ ing="and-red-onion" }, thinly sliced
- [ ] 1 (16-oz) can [black beans]{ ing="black-beans" }, refried beans, or pinto beans, rinsed
- [ ] 1 (16-oz) can [corn]{ ing="corn" }, rinsed
- [ ] 1/2 cup [chunky salsa]{ ing="chunky-salsa" } or a tomato, diced
- [ ] 1/4 cup [onion]{ ing="onion" }, diced
- [ ] [Diced jalapeno]{ ing="diced-jalapeno" }
- [ ] [Avocado]{ ing="avocado" }, diced
- [ ] [Shredded lettuce]{ ing="shredded-lettuce" }
- [ ] [Shredded cheddar cheese]{ ing="shredded-cheddar-cheese" }
- [ ] [Sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }
- [ ] [Hot sauce]{ ing="hot-sauce" }

## Recipe

1. Start the [rice]{ ing="brown-rice" }
1. Prep and rinse the vegetables
1. Prep the meat and/or saute the veggies with the [taco seasoning]{ ing="taco-seasoning" }
1. Heat the [tortillas]{ ing="burrito-sized-tortillas" }
